  <data name="Tour1_Title" xml:space="preserve"><value>Two modes, one product</value></data>
  <data name="Tour1_Body" xml:space="preserve"><value>Novice explains each step and hides the machinery. Expert shows everything: command line, journal, raw JSON. Switch whenever you want — nothing is lost.</value></data>
  <data name="Tour2_Title" xml:space="preserve"><value>Everything revolves around teams</value></data>
  <data name="Tour2_Body" xml:space="preserve"><value>An agent team is the central object: you create it, you keep it, you launch it. The rest of the application only serves that object.</value></data>
  <data name="Tour3_Title" xml:space="preserve"><value>The daily work</value></data>
  <data name="Tour3_Body" xml:space="preserve"><value>Test before launching, run, then find every execution in the history — with its result and everything needed to replay it identically.</value></data>
